# Pharmacy Management System – User Stories

- **US01:** As a pharmacy staff member, I want to log into the system securely, so that only authorized users can access pharmacy information.

- **US02:** As a pharmacist, I want to add, update, and remove medicine records, so that the medicine catalog remains accurate.

- **US03:** As a pharmacist, I want to view current medicine quantities, so that I can monitor available inventory.

- **US04:** As a pharmacist, I want to receive low stock alerts, so that medicines can be reordered before they run out.

- **US05:** As a pharmacy staff member, I want to search for medicines by name or category, so that I can quickly find required medicine information.

- **US06:** As a pharmacist, I want to record and manage customer prescriptions, so that prescription information can be maintained accurately.

- **US07:** As a cashier, I want to process medicine sales and generate bills, so that customers can receive accurate purchase records.

- **US08:** As a pharmacy manager, I want to manage supplier information, so that medicine suppliers can be tracked and contacted when stock needs replenishment.

- **US09:** As a pharmacy manager, I want to view sales and inventory reports, so that pharmacy performance and stock levels can be monitored.

- **US10:** As an administrator, I want to manage staff accounts and access roles, so that system permissions can be controlled appropriately.
